{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>JOIN OUR COUNTRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From leader to golf ball, explore this well aged farm and find your way to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/1.png?t=1749148584\" /><strong>HOW DO I SERVE OUR COUNTRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great question young one. This farm is all about precision and creativity. Use the various objects around you as tools for you to find your own way to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/extras/Trail_Renderer.gif?t=1749148584\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br><strong>WHAT CAN I EXPECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A precision experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed run support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix of the feel from  2D rage platformers into the 3D world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An EMOTIONAL experience</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757360?t=1749148584","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/f861cb1eeb59a7fcf51dee2d7dc9f26aa7b8ceb9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749148584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/4f574d1796b263a5af2c548c9390a1b44ca3ba96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749148584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757360/4f574d1796b263a5af2c548c9390a1b44ca3ba96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749148584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"